  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Security_Point/BH_Security_Point_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"425\"></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Security_Point/BH_Security_Point_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"147\"></h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Модпакет, в который добавлено множество пушек. С модом MrCrayfish's Gun Mod.</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Камеры, сейфы с паролем, шахты и многое другое с модом Securitycraft.</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Новые предметы еды и рецепты с модом Farmers Delight.</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Идеально подходит для SMP- и ролевых серверов!</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://primary.jwwb.nl/public/v/a/q/temp-cndyzglqwdwmdvhfktpp/cbbdh3/bh_security_point_supportbanner.png?enable-io=true&enable=upscale&width=1200\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"147\"></h2>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Нужна помощь с некоторыми модами? Посмотрите на <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.theminemat.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Вики</a></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Некоторые страницы для этого модпака:</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.theminemat.de%252f2022%252f11%252fsecurity-craft.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Securtity Craft</a></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.theminemat.de%252f2022%252f11%252ffarmers-delight-basics.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Farmers Delight</a></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.theminemat.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>- Показать больше</strong></a></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align-center\">Не нашли ответ? Напишите комментарий!</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://primary.jwwb.nl/public/v/a/q/temp-cndyzglqwdwmdvhfktpp/9joiej/bh_security_point_descriptionlinks-1.png?enable-io=true&enable=upscale&width=1200\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"147\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftheminemat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>➡️ Сервер Minecraft (25% скидка)</strong></a></span></h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.theminemat.de%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">➡️ Вики</a></span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/theminemat_live/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">➡️ мои другие модпаки</a></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftheminemat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Security_Point/BH_Security_Point_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"196\"></a></span></p>\n<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftheminemat\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a></h2>",
